{'symbol': 'O', 'date': '2021-09-21 08:00:00', 'title': 'REALTY INCOME ANNOUNCES EXPANSION INTO CONTINENTAL EUROPE: STRATEGIC SALE-LEASEBACK TRANSACTION IN SPAIN', 'text': 'SAN DIEGO, SEPT. 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0REALTY INCOME CORPORATION (REALTY INCOME, NYSE: O), THE MONTHLY DIVIDEND COMPANY®, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE COMPANY HAS CLOSED ON A €93 MILLION SALE-LEASEBACK TRANSACTION IN SPAIN, CONSISTING OF SEVEN PROPERTIES UNDER LONG-TERM NET LEASE AGREEMENTS WITH CARREFOUR AND ITS REAL ESTATE SUBSIDIARY CARREFOUR PROPERTY.'}